    {
      "id": "Buncombe County Open Space Bonds Referendum",
      "title": "Buncombe County Open Space Bonds",
      "summary": "Asks whether to approve an order authorizing $30 million in bonds to acquire and improve land for conservation, including protecting natural resources and preserving farms and scenic landscapes, and to develop parks, greenways, trails and other outdoor recreation. Additional property taxes may be levied to repay the bonds. The ballot estimates the total cost at $47,615,115 ($30 million principal plus $17,615,115 interest) and a tax increase of $4.10 a year per $100,000 of property value.",
